# Trivy ignore list.
# Format: one line per ignored vulnerability.
#   <vuln-id>  <expiry-date>  <reason>
# Example:
#   CVE-2024-12345  2026-12-31  "dev-only dep, fix tracked in JIRA-123"
#
# The expiry date forces a re-review. After the expiry, the
# ignore is removed and the vulnerability will fail the build
# again. This is the "no forever-ignores" rule.
#
# All entries must have a written reason.
# Documentation: https://aquasecurity.github.io/trivy/v0.58/docs/scanner/vulnerability/#how-to-ignore-vulnerabilities
